OL,3,GNEWSAFire chief resigns with 'a real
OL,4,Asense of sadness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuckinghamshire's fire chief has said
OL,7,Fshe has "a real sense of sadness" about
OL,8,Fleaving the role next spring.
OL,10,FLouise Harrison took over the job in
OL,11,F2023 and had previously been a director
OL,12,Fof operations at the Civil Nuclear
OL,13,FConstabulary, having worked in policing
OL,14,Ffor 31 years.
OL,16,FThe fire service revealed her
OL,17,Fresignation on Wednesday, but gave no
OL,18,Fspecific reason for her departure and a
OL,19,Ftimetable for appointing her successor
OL,20,Fhas yet to be announced.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
