OL,3,GNEWSAFire chief resigns with 'a real
OL,4,Asense of sadness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarrison said: "Leading Buckinghamshire
OL,7,FFire and Rescue Service and serving the
OL,8,Fcommunities of Buckinghamshire and
OL,9,FMilton Keynes has been an enormous
OL,10,Fprivilege."
